1. Apprehensive
Worried or nervous about something that may happen.
Tamil: அச்சத்துடன் / கவலையுடன்
Synonyms: Anxious, Uneasy, Worried
🧠 Apprehensive → “What if something goes wrong?”
2. Trepidation
A feeling of fear or nervousness about something that is going to happen.
Tamil: அச்சம் / பதற்றம்
Synonyms: Fear, Anxiety, Dread
🧠 Trepidation = trembling anticipation.
3. Dread
A strong fear about something you expect to happen.
Tamil: பெரும் அச்சம்
Synonyms: Fear, Apprehension, Anxiety
🧠 Dread = “I really don't want this to happen.”
4. Daunted
Feeling intimidated or discouraged by something difficult.
Tamil: அச்சமடைந்து தளர்வடைந்த
Synonyms: Intimidated, Discouraged, Overwhelmed
🧠 Big challenge → “I can't do this!” → Daunted.
5. Intimidated
Feeling frightened or less confident because someone/something seems powerful or difficult.
Tamil: அச்சுறுத்தப்பட்ட / பயமுறுத்தப்பட்ட
Synonyms: Frightened, Overawed, Daunted
🧠 Intimidate = make someone feel small.
6. Overwhelmed
Feeling unable to cope because there is too much to deal with.
Tamil: சமாளிக்க முடியாத அளவு மன அழுத்தம்/சுமை
Synonyms: Overburdened, Overcome
🧠 Too much → overwhelmed.
7. Petrified
Extremely frightened.
Tamil: கடுமையாக பயந்த
Synonyms: Terrified, Horrified
🧠 Petrified → petrified = turned to stone 🪨 because of fear.
8. Horrified
Extremely shocked and frightened or disgusted.
Tamil: அதிர்ச்சியடைந்த / திகைத்த
Synonyms: Appalled, Terrified, Shocked
🧠 Horror → Horrified.
9. Panicked
Suddenly overwhelmed by intense fear.
Tamil: பதற்றத்தில் ஆழ்ந்த
Synonyms: Alarmed, Frantic, Terrified
🧠 Panic = fear that makes you act suddenly.
10. Phobic
Having an extreme or irrational fear of something.
Tamil: ஒரு குறிப்பிட்ட விஷயத்தின் மீது தீவிர பயம் கொண்ட
Synonyms: Fearful, Fear-averse
🧠 Phobia → Phobic
